      "id": 10310902120777,
      "title": "Big roaster drops loading...",
      "handle": "p3000-drops-loading",
      "body_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Hey! If you're new here: welcome. Right now GWO's store is empty on purpose, not broken.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">I'm retiring the Roest L100 and moving fully onto the new roaster (P3000), plus finishing up the crowdfunding rewards. Both need to be done properly before I open the store back up.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Expected timeline: first P3000 drops in October.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Thanks for your patience, hopefully see you back here soon for some coffee :)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Curious what's been roasted before? [<a href=\"https://gwo.coffee/collections/past-releases\">Past releases</a>] →</p>",
