      "id": 10150327288137,
      "title": "Inoi Ndimi",
      "handle": "inoi-ndimi",
      "body_html": "<p>I told you, I’ll always try to keep a Kenyan on the menu. Got this one even though it was expensive bought off another roaster, but that’s been the pattern I’ve gotten used to since I started roasting. I do not regret it, this is a great farm and a great coffee, and some might have caught it on the Lance stream as well, which should back up my claims.</p>\n<p>Hope you enjoy it, and I look forward to the new harvests that start rolling in over the next months 🙂</p>",
