    {
      "id": 10256826007881,
      "title": "Eudis Orosco",
      "handle": "eudis-orosco",
      "body_html": "<p>Also got this from <a href=\"https://coffee-with-dongze.myshopify.com/\">Dongze</a>, who sourced the coffee from an importer in China which went via Canada to the US. He did his drop in May and sent me a sample, which I loved and bugged him to split some with me, and the coffee took another turn around the world to get here. <br><br>I have to say, I'm not completely locked into my notes on this one so I might make some tweaks before printing them and labelling the bags. But I'd say the overall vibe of the coffee aligns with his version, just with a slightly different take from me roast wise.<meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>",
