    {
      "id": 10259654312265,
      "title": "GV Oma tasting set",
      "handle": "gv-oma-tasting-set",
      "body_html": "<p>Another <a href=\"https://coffee-with-dongze.myshopify.com/\">Dongze</a> split, but I'm only doing the washed and honey while he added in a natural lot as well. Theyre very nice coffees, quite typical of Gesha Village non-natural coffees and both have a solid tea note in them. I found it really cool that most of our notes really aligned well, except that I couldnt pick the exact tea notes out from the honey and copied his spring tea note since he's a bigger tea guy than I am. <br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Washed Lot 26/134: Kiwi, Jasmine, Black Tea</li>\n<li>Honey Lot 26/116: Citrus, Bergamot, Four Seasons Spring Tea</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This will be a 2x 50g set, and most likely will be the only GV drop I do this year. <br></p>",
